# service|text: shown when that service doesn't come up during ./kit install
open-webui|open-webui not healthy: its first start downloads a model for documents, which can take a few minutes; run ./kit install again (docker compose logs open-webui).
chat-tailscale|chat-tailscale not healthy means it couldn't join your tailnet: check TS_AUTHKEY in ~/server/secrets.conf (reusable, not expired, its tag in your tailnet policy) (docker compose logs chat-tailscale).
